cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this workflow, please cite the manuscript and the archived repository."
title: "DSC-anchored CALPHAD surrogate pipeline for Ni-base superalloys"
abstract: >-
  Open, end-to-end workflow that links pycalphad with the open MatCalc Ni
  database, trains Gaussian-process, polynomial-chaos and neural-network
  surrogates for DSC-relevant thermal signatures of Ni-base superalloys,
  anchors them against literature DSC, and screens the heat-treatment window
  with uncertainty-aware surrogate optimisation.
